kamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4059360/extras/bfa3f66fbaa6b74c679b5bf977b03b49.poster.avif?t=1764964411\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4059360/extras/bfa3f66fbaa6b74c679b5bf977b03b49.webm?t=1764964411\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4059360/extras/bfa3f66fbaa6b74c679b5bf977b03b49.mp4?t=1764964411\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >FEEL THE RUSH OF SUBURBAN LIFE! COOK RAMEN NOODLES! CONSUME CONTENT! BUY BUY BUY!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4059360/extras/2f8577d721995b056b796d81c932f27b.poster.avif?t=1764964411\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4059360/extras/2f8577d721995b056b796d81c932f27b.webm?t=1764964411\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4059360/extras/2f8577d721995b056b796d81c932f27b.mp4?t=1764964411\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES INCLUDE:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >HAUNTING SUBURBAN ATMOSPHERE!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A PLETHORA OF CHARMING SALESMAN ADVERTISEMENTS!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >FULLY VOICE ACTED STORYLINE!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >SELLING ALL YOUR EARTHLY POSSESSIONS!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >RAMPANT CONSUMERISM!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >FLUSHABLE TOILETS!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >AND SO MUCH MORE!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/ste